    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write Farah a short Monday digest of last week's enquiries for Wanderline Travel.\n\nEnquiries (JSON, each has Date, Name, Email, Message, Enquiry Type):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.data) }}\n\nLeh weather:\n- Now: {{ $('HTTP Request').item.json.current.temperature_2m }} C\n- Dates: {{ $('HTTP Request').item.json.daily.time.join(', ') }}\n- Max temperature on those dates (C): {{ $('HTTP Request').item.json.daily.temperature_2m_max.join(', ') }}\n- Rain on those dates (mm): {{ $('HTTP Request').item.json.daily.precipitation_sum.join(', ') }}\n\nWrite in plain text, under 180 words:\n1. One line with the count of enquiries by type (Bulk Booking, Complaint, Other). Leave Spam out of everything.\n2. One bullet per Bulk Booking and Complaint: the name and a one-line summary.\n3. Weather: if any day shows rain or a sharp temperature drop, start this line with \"WEATHER WARNING:\" and name the day. Otherwise, one line saying conditions look fine for treks.\nDo not invent anything that is not in the data.",
